  "findings": [
    "Both complete silhouettes, floor contact and facial/appendage attachment read in final neutral front, side and top proofs.",
    "Rat paws have four foredigits and five hinddigits, tapered tail, seated ear cups and unequal whiskers. Bite opens the jaw with paired incisors and dark oral material; scurry A/B visibly alternate paw lift.",
    "Cockroach has a low oval body, seated overlapping forewings, small eyes, six jointed legs, shallow abdomen ridges, paired cerci and long tapered antennae. Both gaits and antenna bend are finite and visible.",
    "Cold and warm lighting retain surface identity. The warm-wet proof temporarily multiplies roughness by0.65 only for sensitivity verification; that override is removed before saving the master and is absent from the exported asset.",
    "First proofs were rejected for floating rat facial details/tufts, misplaced upper teeth and clipped roach verification camera; source geometry or proof framing were corrected and final16 proofs were reviewed anew.",
    "A later parent top-view review rejected detached cockroach antenna/cerci roots and a swallowed head. The final correction buries both appendage roots into their actual surface volumes and exposes a short darker head; all eight affected cockroach views were rendered and inspected again. Rat geometry and its eight proof images were unchanged."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Procedurally authored forms remain schematic at close inspection; this is not scanned or photoreal animal art.",
    "Rat fur uses generated albedo, normal details and small geometric guard tufts rather than true hair strands; gait uses shape keys rather than full skeletal locomotion.",
    "Generated chitin retains some painted highlights and marbling. The shallow abdomen seams and thin wing cover forms improve morphology but do not establish entomological realism.",
    "Runtime hand/weapon and enemy contact, crowd density, per-instance GPU morphing, game lighting and actual gameplay remain parent browser QA responsibilities."
  ],
